# Secrets — NEVER commit
config.py
.flask_secret_key

# RDPShield Central (multi-tenant command centre) secrets + runtime state.
# central_config.py holds the DB path and TLS paths; the PEM is the SSO signing
# key, which must never leave the Central host — an instance only ever gets the
# PUBLIC .jwk.json, which can verify a token but never mint one.
# Match central_config.py ANYWHERE, not just in central/. A copy accidentally
# created in the repo root used to shadow the real one (fixed), and without this
# pattern that stray copy would be tracked and committed.
central_config.py
central/.central_secret_key
central/central_sso_private.pem
central/*.pem
# The public JWK is NOT a secret, but it is generated per deployment and each
# install makes its own — committing one host's key would just be misleading.
central/central_sso_public.jwk.json
central/central.db
central/central.db-wal
central/central.db-shm

# Database (runtime data)
rdpshield.db
rdpshield.db-wal
rdpshield.db-shm
*.db

# Logs and generated daily reports (contain attacker data)
*.log
logs/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/

# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Deployment helpers (server-specific). Wildcarded rather than listed by name:
# these contain absolute interpreter paths for one particular host, and a new
# one (run_central.bat) would otherwise be committed by accident.
run_*.bat
panic_unblock.bat

# Local-only working notes and dissertation evidence — NOT published.
# PROGRESS.md is the build log / source of truth for this project, but it
# records the live server's public IP, the scheduled-task + deploy layout and
# notes on which API keys have been exposed. The evidence tree holds real
# attacker data and dissertation screenshots. Both were deliberately removed
# from the public GitHub repo (commits 55f5453 / 2edaf4a, 2026-07-01) and are
# kept here so they stay on disk without ever being pushed again.
PROGRESS.md
evidence/

# Dissertation drafts / Office temp files / DB backups — not part of the tool
*.bak
~$*

# Config backups written by tools/link_central.py before it edits config.py
config.py.*.bak
